  "ig_caption": {
   "en": "You're not busy. You're doing a computer's job by hand, every single day. ⚙️\n\n1️⃣ Someone copies orders from one sheet to another every morning\n✅ Fix: an integration between the tools you already use, on a schedule\n\n2️⃣ The work only happens if one person remembers\n✅ Fix: a scheduled job that runs itself, with a manual override\n\n3️⃣ Duplicates and mistakes show up weeks later\n✅ Fix: validation and deduplication on every run, plus an alert when something needs attention\n\nTidewell Traders is a concept demo.\nSend this to a business owner who needs it.\nDoing the same task by hand every day? Comment AUTOMATE 👇\n\nVoiceover is AI-generated."
  },
